    {
      "source": "S3",
      "quote": "Item B-1.8.1.2: Pipes cables, etc. exceeding 80mm dia but not exceeding 300mm dia. Unit: Mtr. | Rate: Rs. 429.00"
    },
    {
      "source": "S8",
      "quote": "Item B-1.9: Add extra for excavating trenches for pipes, cables, etc. in ordinary/hard rock exceeding 1.5 m in depth but not exceeding 3 m. (Rate is over corresponding basic item for depth upto 1.5 metre.) Unit: % | Rate: 104%"
    }
  ],
  "answer": "The basic rate for excavating a trench in ordinary rock for a pipe of 150 mm diameter (which falls in the 80 mm–300 mm range) is Rs. 429.00 per metre [S3]. Because the trench depth is 2.5 m (which is greater than 1.5 m but not more than 3 m), the extra percentage of 104 % applies [S8]. The total rate per metre is therefore:\n\nRs. 429.00 × (1 + 104/100) = Rs. 429.00 × 2.04 = Rs. 875.16 per metre.\n\nThus, the applicable rate is **Rs. 875.16 per metre**.",
  "missing": ""
}

